@startuml C3_Update_Operation_Plans_Logical_View
title C3 – Operation Plan Update (Logical Architecture)
left to right direction
hide empty members

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor Wheat
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor CornflowerBlue
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor White
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator

rectangle "Angular SPA" as SPA {
  rectangle "Operation Plans Feature" as Feature
  rectangle "Shared Services" as Shared
}

rectangle "TodoApi Gateway" as Api {
  rectangle "OemProxyController" as Controller
  rectangle "OemClient" as Client
  rectangle "Identity Middleware" as Identity
}

cloud "OEM Operation Planning Service" as OEM
cloud "Resource & Staff Catalogs" as Catalogs

Operator --> Feature : UI interactions (HTTPS)
Feature --> Shared : fetch reference data
Feature --> Controller : REST requests
Controller --> Identity : verify authorisation
Controller --> Client : compose OEM HTTP calls
Client --> OEM : Fetch/update plans
Shared --> Catalogs : HTTP GET dropdown data
OEM --> Controller : plan data + warnings
Controller --> Feature : JSON payloads

@enduml
